=== RNG-01: score correction / same-day re-shoot re-save ===
[MATCH] 1a first save of 2 results (control)
    perms=["score_range_days"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=ok
    actual=ok:score
    saved ids: result-1000-0, result-1000-1
    corrected ids: result-2000-0, result-2000-1
[MATCH] 1b corrected re-save (new IDs, old filtered) as instructor
    perms=["score_range_days"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=409
    actual=409 Saved scores and malfunction history cannot be removed from the range workspace.
[MATCH] 1c corrected re-save as Range Master
    perms=["manage_range_days","score_range_days"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=409
    actual=409 Saved scores and malfunction history cannot be removed from the range workspace.
[MATCH] 1d corrected re-save as administrator
    perms=["administer_department","manage_range_days","score_range_days","manage_qualifications"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=409
    actual=409 Saved scores and malfunction history cannot be removed from the range workspace.
[MATCH] 1e control: in-place correction keeping stable ID
    perms=["score_range_days"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=ok
    actual=ok:score
[MATCH] 1f same-day re-shoot of officer-A only (new ID replaces failed attempt)
    perms=["score_range_days"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=409
    actual=409 Saved scores and malfunction history cannot be removed from the range workspace.

=== RNG-03: packetStatus 'Ready' locks the day ===
[MATCH] 3a Range Master sets packetStatus Ready the night before (allowed)
    perms=["manage_range_days","score_range_days"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=ok
    actual=ok:manage
[MATCH] 3b first score add on the 'Ready' (not completed) day, instructor
    perms=["score_range_days"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=409
    actual=409 Completed, locked, archived, or finalized range records cannot be changed.
[MATCH] 3c first score add on the 'Ready' day, administrator
    perms=["administer_department","manage_range_days","score_range_days","manage_qualifications"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=409
    actual=409 Completed, locked, archived, or finalized range records cannot be changed.
[MATCH] 3d status Planned->In Progress on the Ready day
    perms=["administer_department","manage_range_days","score_range_days","manage_qualifications"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=409
    actual=409 Completed, locked, archived, or finalized range records cannot be changed.
[MATCH] 3e revert packetStatus Ready->In Progress (unlock attempt), administrator
    perms=["administer_department","manage_range_days","score_range_days","manage_qualifications"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=409
    actual=409 Completed, locked, archived, or finalized range records cannot be changed.
[MATCH] 3f roster attendance change on the Ready day
    perms=["manage_range_days","score_range_days"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=409
    actual=409 Completed, locked, archived, or finalized range records cannot be changed.

=== RNG-04: Completed is irreversible ===
[MATCH] 4a set status Completed (one write, no extra checks)
    perms=["manage_range_days","score_range_days"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=ok
    actual=ok:manage
[MATCH] 4b edit a score on the Completed day (stable ID), administrator
    perms=["administer_department","manage_range_days","score_range_days","manage_qualifications"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=409
    actual=409 Completed, locked, archived, or finalized range records cannot be changed.
[MATCH] 4c add AAR text after close-out (RNG-21)
    perms=["administer_department","manage_range_days","score_range_days","manage_qualifications"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=409
    actual=409 Completed, locked, archived, or finalized range records cannot be changed.
[MATCH] 4d reopen Completed->In Progress, administrator
    perms=["administer_department","manage_range_days","score_range_days","manage_qualifications"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=409
    actual=409 Completed, locked, archived, or finalized range records cannot be changed.
[MATCH] 4e Completed->Archived
    perms=["administer_department","manage_range_days","score_range_days","manage_qualifications"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=409
    actual=409 Completed, locked, archived, or finalized range records cannot be changed.
[MATCH] 4f restore Archived->Planned, administrator
    perms=["administer_department","manage_range_days","score_range_days","manage_qualifications"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=409
    actual=409 Completed, locked, archived, or finalized range records cannot be changed.

=== RNG-13: two devices, full-document PUTs ===
[MATCH] 13a device A PUT (server state = base)
    perms=["score_range_days"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=ok
    actual=ok:score
[MATCH] 13b device B PUT after A landed (server state = A), B lacks A's result
    perms=["score_range_days"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=409
    actual=409 Saved scores and malfunction history cannot be removed from the range workspace.
[MATCH] 13c control: B merges A's results then PUTs
    perms=["score_range_days"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=ok
    actual=ok:score
[MATCH] 13d stale planning write by B after A's title edit (lost update, accepted)
    perms=["manage_range_days","score_range_days"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=ok
    actual=ok:manage

=== Related: RNG-11 / RNG-22 / RNG-23 ===
[MATCH] 11a load-time normalization adds attendanceMode to a legacy Completed day
    perms=["manage_range_days","score_range_days"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=409
    actual=409 Completed, locked, archived, or finalized range records cannot be changed.
[MATCH] 11b library normalization (defaultRunCount) sent by scorer-only user
    perms=["score_range_days"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=403
    actual=403 Range-day planning and drill-library changes require range management permission.
[MATCH] 22a roster removal that also deletes the officer's results
    perms=["manage_range_days","score_range_days"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=409
    actual=409 Saved scores and malfunction history cannot be removed from the range workspace.
[MATCH] 23a re-save line recreating the malfunction with new ID/type
    perms=["score_range_days"]
    expected(defect behaviour)=409
    actual=409 Saved scores and malfunction history cannot be removed from the range workspace.
